  "whatsapp_greeting": "Hi there \ud83d\udc9a I'm Grace, your companion in recovery. I'm in long-term recovery myself and I'm here to listen deeply, offer hope, and help you feel the belonging that makes recovery not just possible, but probable. Connection prevents crisis. What's on your heart today?",
